cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss this work, please cite the paper listed under preferred-citation."
title: "A Constructive N-Series Acceleration Law for Polygonal Approximation of π"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Baker"
    given-names: "Wayne"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-22"

repository-code: "https://github.com/CWBaker360/N-Series-pi-acceleration"
url: "https://github.com/CWBaker360/N-Series-pi-acceleration"

abstract: >-
  This repository contains the manuscript source and supporting materials for
  a constructive N-Series acceleration law for polygonal approximation of pi.
  The paper gives a geometric interpretation of Richardson-type cancellation,
  derives the even-power error structure, proves two-scale and multiscale
  cancellation laws, and records a pi-free algebraic chord-trisection
  verification.

keywords:
  - "polygonal approximation"
  - "pi"
  - "Richardson extrapolation"
  - "N-series"
  - "chord trisection"
  - "constructive geometry"
  - "asymptotic acceleration"

